    {
      "id": "claim_9a9a8c924f994f7cbfdd7ba82ecad769",
      "statement": "A tax-loss-harvest replacement in the municipal allocation must satisfy the municipal sector limit at settlement, so a replacement that concentrates a preferred sector above the limit is a breach on settlement.",
