    {
      "id": "claim_b379464390cf4459ae0bc05063564bbe",
      "statement": "Each target weight has a ±2-percentage-point market-value tolerance measured at month end; ordinary drift outside the band is rebalanced in the next monthly cycle and requires approval under the discretion matrix.",
