    {
      "id": "claim_db2eca688033459d8c190858f0d510a4",
      "statement": "A cited research note's supersession or withdrawal suspends the weights derived from it rather than triggering automatic rebalancing or manager-led recalculation; the manager must escalate the superseded note, any replacement, dependent weights, and affected accounts to the Committee, which alone can re-adopt a binding control.",
